@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1

### 1. 422 Validation Failed: Negative price & unserved area on dish
POST {{baseUrl}}/dishes
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "restaurant_id": 1,
  "price": -500,
  "is_fasting": true,
  "area": "Sululta"
}

### 2. 422 Validation Failed: Invalid TeleBirr phone number on restaurant
POST {{baseUrl}}/restaurants
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Kitchen",
  "slug": "test-kitchen",
  "area": "Bole",
  "phone": "12345",
  "opening_hours": "08:00 - 22:00"
}

### 3. 422 Validation Failed: Empty order lines & nonexistent dish_id
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "area": "Bole",
  "phone": "0911234567",
  "lines": [
    { "dish_id": 999999, "qty": 0 }
  ]
}

### 4. 201 Created: Valid order with +251 phone normalization
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "area": "Bole",
  "phone": "+251 911-234-567",
  "notes": "Call on arrival",
  "lines": [
    { "dish_id": 1, "qty": 2 }
  ]
}

### 5. 409 Conflict: Illegal order status transition (placed -> delivered skips preparing/dispatched)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/16/status
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "delivered"
}

### 6. 404 Not Found: Missing dish ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/dishes/999999
Accept: application/json

### 7. 404 Route Not Found: Unknown endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/unknown-endpoint
Accept: application/json

### 8. 405 Method Not Allowed: PATCH on collection route
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders
Accept: application/json
